SUMMARY:CHAP Art Club
DESCRIPTION:Have fun making art with CHAP! These workshops are designed for children with medical challenges at their Hillsboro Art Studio. Thursdays from 12pm-2pm and Saturday from 10am -12pm.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/chap-art-club/2026-05-14/
